 to complete a giant robot, struggling hard to avoid losing the club's status.\n\nThen, one day, Kaito discovers the A.R. annotation that becomes the Kimijima Report. Written in that report is the indictment of someone named Kou Kimijima's conspiracy involving the world.\n\n(Source: VNdb)"},"tags":[{"name":"Robots","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":96,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School Club","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Video Games","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Augmented Reality","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":74,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Hikikomori","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mopeds","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Human Experimentation","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Robotics;Notes","english":"Robotics;Notes","native":"Robotics;Notes","romaji":"Robotics;Notes","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"机器人笔记"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ロボティクス・ノーツ"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ロボティクス;ノーツ"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机械学报告"}]},"trailer":{"id":"axP0uUhICmk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/axP0uUhICmk/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}